 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Every thirty-nine feet,",
   "s": 0.152,
   "e": 1.427
  },
  {
   "text": "this railroad worker cuts a gap in the track.",
   "s": 1.67,
   "e": 3.947
  },
  {
   "text": "On purpose.",
   "s": 4.362,
   "e": 5.079
  },
  {
   "text": "It's the eighteen-hundreds,",
   "s": 5.503,
   "e": 6.636
  },
  {
   "text": "and his rival thinks he's an idiot.",
   "s": 6.793,
   "e": 8.426
  },
  {
   "text": "Gaps make trains bounce.",
   "s": 8.838,
   "e": 10.447
  },
  {
   "text": "Clickety-clack,",
   "s": 10.76,
   "e": 11.436
  },
  {
   "text": "all day long.",
   "s": 11.666,
   "e": 12.499
  },
  {
   "text": "So the rival builds the perfect railroad.",
   "s": 12.965,
   "e": 15.155
  },
  {
   "text": "No gaps.",
   "s": 15.465,
   "e": 16.213
  },
  {
   "text": "Smooth steel,",
   "s": 16.509,
   "e": 17.435
  },
  {
   "text": "end to end, straight across the desert.",
   "s": 17.661,
   "e": 19.659
  },
  {
   "text": "His trains glide in total silence.",
   "s": 20.199,
   "e": 22.441
  },
  {
   "text": "Passengers love it.",
   "s": 22.839,
   "e": 23.866
  },
  {
   "text": "The newspapers call it the future.",
   "s": 24.261,
   "e": 25.897
  },
  {
   "text": "Then summer arrives.",
   "s": 26.483,
   "e": 27.721
  },
  {
   "text": "The sun bakes the rails all afternoon,",
   "s": 28.097,
   "e": 30.363
  },
  {
   "text": "and steel does something sneaky.",
   "s": 30.669,
   "e": 32.349
  },
  {
   "text": "It grows.",
   "s": 33.189,
   "e": 33.828
  },
  {
   "text": "One short rail only grows a tiny bit.",
   "s": 34.319,
   "e": 36.488
  },
  {
   "text": "But a whole mile of steel with no gaps?",
   "s": 36.878,
   "e": 39.241
  },
  {
   "text": "It needs almost two feet of extra room,",
   "s": 39.593,
   "e": 41.67
  },
  {
   "text": "and there's nowhere to go.",
   "s": 41.916,
   "e": 42.846
  },
  {
   "text": "So the track shoves itself sideways,",
   "s": 43.311,
   "e": 45.382
  },
  {
   "text": "into a giant snake-shaped bend.",
   "s": 45.521,
   "e": 47.571
  },
  {
   "text": "And the afternoon train is heading right for it.",
   "s": 47.999,
   "e": 50.346
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 50.837,
   "e": 51.214
  },
  {
   "text": "those little gaps were never mistakes.",
   "s": 51.416,
   "e": 53.433
  },
  {
   "text": "They were breathing room.",
   "s": 53.802,
   "e": 54.797
  },
  {
   "text": "And here's the crazy part.",
   "s": 55.269,
   "e": 56.523
  },
  {
   "text": "Most railroads today really have no gaps.",
   "s": 56.915,
   "e": 59.413
  },
  {
   "text": "Engineers stretch the steel tight and lay it on a hot day,",
   "s": 59.795,
   "e": 62.913
  },
  {
   "text": "so summer has nothing left to push.",
   "s": 63.195,
   "e": 65.133
  }
 ]
